1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:10,673
Euronews reports that a Russia sanctions bill in the US Senate could give President Donald Trump broad power to place tariffs on both rivals and allies.

2
00:00:10,623 --> 00:00:17,064
European officials worry the measure may hit companies that still trade with Russia indirectly.

3
00:00:17,064 --> 00:00:25,049
The debate shows how sanctions, energy policy and transatlantic trade can become linked in difficult ways.

